  "description": "Proposal: Observation profile for the request 'Specific microscopy', derived from MII_PR_Mikrobio_Spezifische_Mikroskopie. Observation.code is bound (required) to the ValueSet MII_VS_Mikrobio_LOINC_Ontology_Specific_Microscopy_Threshold, which is defined by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-10-21. Everything else is inherited from the module profile.",
  "copyright": "This material includes SNOMED Clinical Terms® (SNOMED CT®) which is used by permission of SNOMED International. All rights reserved. SNOMED CT®, was originally created by The College of American Pathologists. SNOMED and SNOMED CT are registered trademarks of SNOMED International. Implementers of these artefacts must have the appropriate SNOMED CT Affiliate license.",
  "fhirVersion": "4.0.1",
  "kind": "resource",
  "abstract": false,
  "type": "Observation",
  "baseDefinition": "https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/modul-mikrobio/StructureDefinition/mii-pr-mikrobio-spezifische-mikroskopie",
  "derivation": "constraint",
  "differential": {
    "element": [
      {
        "id": "Observation.code",
        "path": "Observation.code",
        "binding": {
          "strength": "required",
          "valueSet": "https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/modul-mikrobio/ValueSet/mii-vs-mikrobio-loinc-ontology-specific-microscopy-threshold",
          "description": "LOINC codes of the request, computed by ECL over the LOINC Ontology 2026-10-21. Specific microscopy — ordinal threshold presence by microscopy or staining technique: `<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)|), 370132008 |Scale type (attribute)| = 117363000 |Ordinal value (qualifier value)|, 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = (<< 278289002 |Microscopy technique (qualifier value)| OR << 703857004 |Staining technique (qualifier value)|)`"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
